1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,236
One footnote.

2
00:00:01,236 --> 00:00:04,778
Tobacco mosaic virus has no DNA at all.

3
00:00:04,778 --> 00:00:14,348
When Fraenkel Conrat and Singer swapped the RNA and the protein coat between two strains, the new viruses always matched the RNA donor.

4
00:00:14,348 --> 00:00:18,567
So in some viruses, RNA is the genetic material.

